      `the deployer uses the AI system in the course of a purely personal non-professional activity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the deployer use the AI system in the course of a purely personal non-professional activity?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 2(10), as a person affected by an AI system, does the Regulation apply to the obligations of a deployer who is a natural person using AI systems for a purely personal non-professional activity` IS
    `Art 2(10) the Regulation applies to the obligations of the natural person deployer using AI systems for a purely personal non-professional activity` `the date asked` `the deployer of the AI system is a natural person` `the deployer uses the AI system in the course of a purely personal non-professional activity`


