      `the law, regulation, administrative provision or collective agreement is more favourable to workers in terms of protecting their rights in respect of the use of AI systems by employers` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the law, regulation, administrative provision or collective agreement more favourable to workers in protecting their rights in respect of the use of AI systems by employers?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
