§§ `Article 5(1): the prohibited AI practices`

@export Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(a) (subliminal, manipulative or deceptive techniques that distort behaviour)?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the AI system deploys subliminal techniques beyond a person's consciousness` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system deploys subliminal techniques beyond a person's consciousness?
      `the AI system deploys purposefully manipulative or deceptive techniques` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system deploys purposefully manipulative or deceptive techniques?
      `the technique has the objective, or the effect, of materially distorting the behaviour of a person or a group of persons by appreciably impairing their ability to make an informed decision` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the technique has the objective, or the effect, of materially distorting the behaviour of a person or a group of persons by appreciably impairing their ability to make an informed decision?
      `the person or group of persons is thereby caused to take a decision that they would not have otherwise taken` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person or group of persons is thereby caused to take a decision that they would not have otherwise taken?
      `the decision is taken in a manner that causes or is reasonably likely to cause that person, another person or group of persons significant harm` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the decision is taken in a manner that causes or is reasonably likely to cause that person, another person or group of persons significant harm?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(a) (subliminal, manipulative or deceptive techniques that distort behaviour)` IS
    `Art 5(1)(a) the AI practice is prohibited` `the date asked` `the AI system deploys subliminal techniques beyond a person's consciousness` `the AI system deploys purposefully manipulative or deceptive techniques` `the technique has the objective, or the effect, of materially distorting the behaviour of a person or a group of persons by appreciably impairing their ability to make an informed decision` `the person or group of persons is thereby caused to take a decision that they would not have otherwise taken` `the decision is taken in a manner that causes or is reasonably likely to cause that person, another person or group of persons significant harm`

@export Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(b) (exploiting vulnerabilities due to age, disability or a specific social or economic situation)?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the AI system exploits any of the vulnerabilities of a natural person or a specific group of persons due to their age, disability or a specific social or economic situation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system exploits any of the vulnerabilities of a natural person or a specific group of persons due to their age, disability or a specific social or economic situation?
      `the AI system has the objective, or the effect, of materially distorting the behaviour of that person or a person belonging to that group` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system has the objective, or the effect, of materially distorting the behaviour of that person or a person belonging to that group?
      `the distortion is in a manner that causes or is reasonably likely to cause that person or another person significant harm` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the distortion is in a manner that causes or is reasonably likely to cause that person or another person significant harm?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(b) (exploiting vulnerabilities due to age, disability or a specific social or economic situation)` IS
    `Art 5(1)(b) the AI practice is prohibited` `the date asked` `the AI system exploits any of the vulnerabilities of a natural person or a specific group of persons due to their age, disability or a specific social or economic situation` `the AI system has the objective, or the effect, of materially distorting the behaviour of that person or a person belonging to that group` `the distortion is in a manner that causes or is reasonably likely to cause that person or another person significant harm`

@export Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(ba) (generating or manipulating intimate or sexually explicit material of an identifiable person without consent)?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the AI system generates realistic images, videos, audio or similar material` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system generates realistic images, videos, audio or similar material?
      `the AI system manipulates realistic images, videos, audio or similar material` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system manipulates realistic images, videos, audio or similar material?
      `the material is of an identifiable natural person's intimate parts, or of an identifiable natural person engaged in sexually explicit activities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the material is of an identifiable natural person's intimate parts, or of an identifiable natural person engaged in sexually explicit activities?
      `the person has given freely-given, specific, informed, unambiguous and explicit consent for that generation or manipulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person has given freely-given, specific, informed, unambiguous and explicit consent for that generation or manipulation?
      `the manipulation does not increase the exposure of any depicted intimate parts or alter the nature of any depicted sexually explicit activities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the manipulation does not increase the exposure of any depicted intimate parts or alter the nature of any depicted sexually explicit activities?
      `that generation or manipulation is the intended purpose of the AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that that generation or manipulation is the intended purpose of the AI system?
      `the system's design, training, architecture, capabilities or user-facing functionalities make that generation or manipulation a reasonably foreseeable and reproducible outcome, without requiring significant technical modification` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the system's design, training, architecture, capabilities or user-facing functionalities make that generation or manipulation a reasonably foreseeable and reproducible outcome, without requiring significant technical modification?
      `the system has reasonable and adequate technical safety measures and other safeguards to reliably prevent that generation or manipulation, taking into account reasonably foreseeable misuse, and to correct observed or reported misuse` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the system has reasonable and adequate technical safety measures and other safeguards to reliably prevent that generation or manipulation, taking into account reasonably foreseeable misuse, and to correct observed or reported misuse?
      `the deployer uses the system for the purpose of generating or manipulating such material or performance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the deployer uses the system for the purpose of generating or manipulating such material or performance?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(ba) (generating or manipulating intimate or sexually explicit material of an identifiable person without consent)` IS
    `Art 5(1)(ba) the AI practice is prohibited` `the date asked` `Art 5(1) act use` `the AI system generates realistic images, videos, audio or similar material` `the AI system manipulates realistic images, videos, audio or similar material` `the material is of an identifiable natural person's intimate parts, or of an identifiable natural person engaged in sexually explicit activities` `the person has given freely-given, specific, informed, unambiguous and explicit consent for that generation or manipulation` `the manipulation does not increase the exposure of any depicted intimate parts or alter the nature of any depicted sexually explicit activities` `that generation or manipulation is the intended purpose of the AI system` `the system's design, training, architecture, capabilities or user-facing functionalities make that generation or manipulation a reasonably foreseeable and reproducible outcome, without requiring significant technical modification` `the system has reasonable and adequate technical safety measures and other safeguards to reliably prevent that generation or manipulation, taking into account reasonably foreseeable misuse, and to correct observed or reported misuse` `the deployer uses the system for the purpose of generating or manipulating such material or performance`

