@export Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(c) (social scoring)?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the AI system is for the evaluation or classification of natural persons or groups of persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is for the evaluation or classification of natural persons or groups of persons?
      `the evaluation or classification is over a certain period of time` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the evaluation or classification is over a certain period of time?
      `the evaluation or classification is based on their social behaviour or known, inferred or predicted personal or personality characteristics` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the evaluation or classification is based on their social behaviour or known, inferred or predicted personal or personality characteristics?
      `the social score leads to detrimental or unfavourable treatment of certain natural persons or groups of persons in social contexts that are unrelated to the contexts in which the data was originally generated or collected` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the social score leads to detrimental or unfavourable treatment of certain natural persons or groups of persons in social contexts that are unrelated to the contexts in which the data was originally generated or collected?
      `the social score leads to detrimental or unfavourable treatment of certain natural persons or groups of persons that is unjustified or disproportionate to their social behaviour or its gravity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the social score leads to detrimental or unfavourable treatment of certain natural persons or groups of persons that is unjustified or disproportionate to their social behaviour or its gravity?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(c) (social scoring)` IS
    `Art 5(1)(c) the AI practice is prohibited` `the date asked` `the AI system is for the evaluation or classification of natural persons or groups of persons` `the evaluation or classification is over a certain period of time` `the evaluation or classification is based on their social behaviour or known, inferred or predicted personal or personality characteristics` `the social score leads to detrimental or unfavourable treatment of certain natural persons or groups of persons in social contexts that are unrelated to the contexts in which the data was originally generated or collected` `the social score leads to detrimental or unfavourable treatment of certain natural persons or groups of persons that is unjustified or disproportionate to their social behaviour or its gravity`

@export Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(d) (risk assessments of natural persons based solely on profiling or personality traits)?
