      `the AI system is used for making risk assessments of natural persons in order to assess or predict the risk of a natural person committing a criminal offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is used for making risk assessments of natural persons in order to assess or predict the risk of a natural person committing a criminal offence?
      `the risk assessment is based solely on the profiling of a natural person or on assessing their personality traits and characteristics` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the risk assessment is based solely on the profiling of a natural person or on assessing their personality traits and characteristics?
      `the AI system is used to support the human assessment of the involvement of a person in a criminal activity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is used to support the human assessment of the involvement of a person in a criminal activity?
      `that human assessment is already based on objective and verifiable facts directly linked to a criminal activity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that that human assessment is already based on objective and verifiable facts directly linked to a criminal activity?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(d) (risk assessments of natural persons based solely on profiling or personality traits)` IS
    `Art 5(1)(d) the AI practice is prohibited` `the date asked` `Art 5(1) act use` FALSE `the AI system is used for making risk assessments of natural persons in order to assess or predict the risk of a natural person committing a criminal offence` `the risk assessment is based solely on the profiling of a natural person or on assessing their personality traits and characteristics` `the AI system is used to support the human assessment of the involvement of a person in a criminal activity` `that human assessment is already based on objective and verifiable facts directly linked to a criminal activity`

