§ `Under Article 50`
-- SITUATION: This group arises only if an AI system of a kind Article 50 names has been used on the person or has produced content the person has met (one that interacts with them, generates synthetic content, recognises emotions or categorises people biometrically, or generates a deep fake or text published to inform the public); the form can first ask "Has an AI system been used on you, or produced content you have seen?".

-- Article 50(1): Art 50(1) the provider must ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system
@export Under Article 50(1), as a person affected by an AI system, must the provider of the AI system ensure that I am informed that I am interacting with an AI system?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the AI system is intended to interact directly with natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to interact directly with natural persons?
      `this is obvious from the point of view of a natural person who is reasonably well-informed, observant and circumspect, taking into account the circumstances and the context of use` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that this is obvious from the point of view of a natural person who is reasonably well-informed, observant and circumspect, taking into account the circumstances and the context of use?
      `the AI system is authorised by law to detect, prevent, investigate or prosecute criminal offences` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is authorised by law to detect, prevent, investigate or prosecute criminal offences?
      `that authorisation is subject to appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of third parties` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that that authorisation is subject to appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of third parties?
      `the AI system is available for the public to report a criminal offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is available for the public to report a criminal offence?
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to a product covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if the AI system is not high-risk because of Article 6(1).
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
