§ `Under Article 86(1)`

@ref Art 86(1)
@export Under Article 86(1), as a person affected by an AI system, do I have the right to obtain from the deployer clear and meaningful explanations?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the person is an affected person subject to a decision` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you subject to a decision (an affected person)?
      `the decision is taken by the deployer on the basis of the output from the AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the decision taken by the deployer on the basis of the output from the AI system?
      `the AI system is listed in Annex III under a point other than point 2` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system listed in Annex III under a point other than point 2?
      `the AI system is listed in Annex III under point 2` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system listed in Annex III under point 2?
      `the decision produces legal effects or similarly significantly affects the person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the decision produce legal effects, or similarly significantly affect the person?
      `the person considers that the decision has an adverse impact on their health, safety or fundamental rights` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the person consider that the decision has an adverse impact on their health, safety or fundamental rights?
      `an exception or restriction follows from Union or national law in compliance with Union law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does an exception or restriction follow from Union or national law in compliance with Union law?
      `the right is otherwise provided for under Union law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the right otherwise provided for under Union law?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 86(1), as a person affected by an AI system, do I have the right to obtain from the deployer clear and meaningful explanations` IS
    `Art 86(1) the affected person has the right to obtain from the deployer clear and meaningful explanations` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the person is an affected person subject to a decision` `the decision is taken by the deployer on the basis of the output from the AI system` `the AI system is listed in Annex III under a point other than point 2` `the AI system is listed in Annex III under point 2` `the decision produces legal effects or similarly significantly affects the person` `the person considers that the decision has an adverse impact on their health, safety or fundamental rights` `an exception or restriction follows from Union or national law in compliance with Union law` `the right is otherwise provided for under Union law`
    WHERE
        `the AI system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`

